{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09128","headline":"饯雍聿之潞州谒李中丞 · 韦应物","name":"饯雍聿之潞州谒李中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郁郁雨相遇，出门草青青。\n酒酣拔劒舞，慷慨送子行。\n驱马涉大河，日暮怀洛京。\n前登太行路，志士亦未平。\n薄游五府都，高步振英声。\n主人才且贤，重士百金轻。\n丝竹促飞觞，夜醼达晨星。\n娱乐易淹暮，谅在执高情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}